     NOTE this is a DFS channel. The window shows no hold and no vacate, and
          ten unbroken minutes of this channel were measured showing neither,
          but a hold is rare and abrupt and no window at 1 Hz has the power to
          exclude one. The run's own trace is where that gets settled, and a
          run taken here is not comparable with one taken off a radar band.
